o III's forces suffered a decisive defeat against al-Mansur at the Battle of Rueda in 981."}, {"sourceSlug": "bermudo-ii-of-león", "sourceName": "Bermudo II of León", "verb": "SUCCEEDS", "targetSlug": "ramiro-iii-of-león", "targetName": "Ramiro III of León", "context": "Bermudo II deposed Ramiro III in 984 and subsequently succeeded him as King of León."}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-07-12T09:49:37Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#29187767023", "field": "detailsJson.places", "oldValue": [], "newValue": [{"name": "León, Spain", "role": "Capital of Kingdom"}, {"name": "Rueda, Spain", "role": "Major Battle Site"}, {"name": "Astorga, Spain", "role": "Place of Death"}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-07-12T09:49:37Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#29187767023", "field": "subjects", "oldValue": ["Monarchs & Rulers"], "newValue": ["León", "Spain", "Monarchy", "Medieval Warfare", "Christian Kingdoms", "Reconquista", "Iberian History", "Political Instability", "Nobility"]}, {"timestamp": "2026-07-12T09:49:37Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#29187767023", "field": "frameworks", "oldValue": ["POLITICAL_SYSTEMS", "EMPIRE_AND_COLONIALISM", "GEOPOLITICAL_LINKAGE", "TEMPORAL_LINKAGE"], "newValue": ["STRUCTURAL_ANALYSIS", "DIPLOMATIC_HISTORY", "CAUSE_AND_EFFECT"]}], "_unsyncedEdits": true}
